error[E0065]: cannot pass `T` for a bound of `keep`: the type parameter `T` has no bound
  --> tests/ui/08-interfaces/bounds/bound_needs_descriptor.cheby:14:3
   |
14 |   keep(value)
   |   ^^^^^^^^^^^ required by a bound of `keep`
